[{"title":"刘媪送酒 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"康衢声响罢陶陶，饥饿相寻到我曹。\n美酝二升殊可恋，野人何事笑东皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘媪送酒 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"谁将白鹤与青蚨，十五桥边卖酒垆。\n赖是东邻刘老媪，一筒满眼不须沽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘媪送酒 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"襟颜何处不曾开，世短情多白发催。\n一曲高歌还自听，青山笑覆白云杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承嘉弟遣弟承规挈舟送客武昌舟还金矶适族弟承敬会矶下许相挽而上舟覆规与敬得拯规遂舍舟而归承嘉欲令规求舟止以诗","author":"庄昶","text":"尔弟矶头真陆沉，茫茫不记此来心。\n扁舟值得曾多少，天与平安抵万金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承颜弟书来有眼底流涎摇尾之叹诗以复之","author":"庄昶","text":"商人门户几黄昏，云际疏星过雨痕。\n赤脚大匡千丈雪，婆娑短褐半生温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画龙","author":"庄昶","text":"作醢相逢信不虚，神灵应迓犬羊如。\n普天霖雨当年寄，不到寒湫祗卧馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画虎","author":"庄昶","text":"短薄远山葵藿知，也教冯妇下车迟。\n晓天一啸长风起，试问人间老画师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崧台别意卷为巴陵方氏","author":"庄昶","text":"瘦马炎荒寄宦情，乌纱巾外野云青。\n而今万里高秋兴，犹在三洲与七星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢惠鱼","author":"庄昶","text":"竹箩犯晓压肩低，枉辱鲜鳞色色齐。\n冰雪有人烟浪里，几番昏晓不闻鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓枕","author":"庄昶","text":"风寻里裂几年衾，楼外梅花月色深。\n流动春光都满眼，自将功业问成心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄严先生罢任","author":"庄昶","text":"纱帽閒眠背夕阳，几年歌里听沧浪。\n夜来风雨宣城梦，千里蘼芜满地香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和沈大有国宾韵 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"人间难记定难忘，眼底鱼潜共鸟翔。\n开户一番飞动意，满檐春雨墨花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和沈大有国宾韵 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"戚里春光未易逢，朱门䆗窱杳难穷。\n不多岐路驱驰里，无限珠玑咳唾中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花园四时词 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"残山剩水也春光，何谢园池旧洛阳。\n秉烛放歌天欲晓，雨香檐外更花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花园四时词 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"藤床兀兀己抛书，起倒无馀懒有馀。\n花到蔷薇好报道，老头今亦为渠梳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花园四时词 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"月亦停杯花亦停，又生恤纬后来情。\n声横南徼千山马，势破西天万里鹰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花园四时词 其四","author":"庄昶","text":"短褐人间无紫凤，连村□□足清波。\n气含公鼎花神笑，影对寒崖十丈萝。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵升卿弟 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"拖犁蚤穗已成科，拾穗有人行且歌。\n弋路自来还自去，今人心契古人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵升卿弟 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"泯泯日长人独坐，关关风静鸟同歌。\n尘心生死全消未，天损分明不爱多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵升卿弟 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"七尺自临潭底影，一瓢不聒树头风。\n安心了了无言说，兴味都归半醉中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵升卿弟 其四","author":"庄昶","text":"彼此衰荣并一空，夜来急雨战惊风。\n午窗忽启初晴日，宇宙无端过眼中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鲁仲连","author":"庄昶","text":"东海停波万顷馀，天行物化卷还舒。\n一诬千载凭谁说，曾射聊城一纸书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画梅","author":"庄昶","text":"铁桥曾识春风面，玉铉终和上帝亨。\n散步江村霜月午，仙香万斛引丹青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"泉石清凉寄此身，市廛喧聒不闻人。\n玄同自得今犹古，分别应惭我到君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"阿母棚中犬骨收，仰眠对语小詹头。\n少将故事留诗活，不为儿孙骨相谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃林书屋为临江方文亨","author":"庄昶","text":"片霞香点万书堆，手倦抛书拨篆灰。\n多少旁人迷指顾，是天台不是天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳顶精舍为巴陵柳汝澜","author":"庄昶","text":"坐久有人苔涩扉，颓然深处见天机。\n午帏风启跏趺去，影在青天几翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈大有 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"水月相磨势两忘，千寻水月有蛟藏。\n鄂城今夜思千里，一首书残一炷香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈大有 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"枕窍孤眠梦已忘，人间两手漫收藏。\n祝融风满游人袖，一片崖兰万斛香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜闻邻舟铃","author":"庄昶","text":"阙足床旁折脚铛，全成人是我全成。\n洞庭混沌清波耳，不聒人间昨夜铃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感昔","author":"庄昶","text":"拗鬼纷更智已疲，鱼羹无复草根知。\n只今回首金陵地，炰凤烹龙去合迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄喻祁阳子乾 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"十丈青霓落语溪，茅茨移采午天低。\n焚香闭阁君侯梦，千里烟霞路更西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄喻祁阳子乾 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"谩说鸦山与建溪，九疑仙谷露丛低。\n轻黄脆绿香凝玉，坐醉中秋月影西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵喻祁阳子乾见赠 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"拂几弹丝风满城，此刀千载砉然惊。\n千寻一进竿头步，始信前贤畏后生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵喻祁阳子乾见赠 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"竹绕官衙水绕城，帘前不到野人惊。\n坐残水竹边头影，十丈婆娑月又生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵喻祁阳子乾见赠 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"潇湘云雾锁丛林，玉色荷花许样深。\n只恐尘巾看花眼，龙宫幽渺不知寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵喻祁阳子乾见赠 其四","author":"庄昶","text":"樵歌落日风满林，渔唱前湾夜气深。\n此曲人间元不解，离鸾别鹤会相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵喻祁阳子乾见赠 其五","author":"庄昶","text":"度十溪深更百溪，野云茅屋打头低。\n云香莫遣闻猿鸟，逼得青鸾驾又西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵喻祁阳子乾见赠 其六","author":"庄昶","text":"破笠不眠云在溪，两肩诗竦竹篷低。\n波喧厉气风来北，山吐微光月出西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄曾复初先生","author":"庄昶","text":"草草当年启一音，洞庭东下笑鱼沉。\n瘦筇拄破郴山雪，兴绕梅花独不禁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宜章再寄高挥使","author":"庄昶","text":"小队貔貅影作双，云为伞盖柳为幢。\n遥瞻万里元戎气，吞尽东南未肯降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳溪图","author":"庄昶","text":"溪北溪南着树遮，一溪风日一溪花。\n君王莫遣丹青得，留与桃源一样誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅","author":"庄昶","text":"影落寒空月一痕，烟霞剩馥倩谁闻。\n和羹欲试人间手，商鼎秋尘净几分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨牡丹","author":"庄昶","text":"本看魏紫与姚黄，开卷谁家澹墨光。\n意思但知花一我，眼中色相已都忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中陪沈仲律佥宪宿长芦用韵","author":"庄昶","text":"孤帆兼日下，高树与秋迎。\n天地真能大，江山各自清。\n宦游吾马倦，尘梦此钟鸣。\n默默同趺坐，谁知万古情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋行","author":"庄昶","text":"老夫携一杖，岸帻向林皋。\n九月木将脱，千峰秋更高。\n乾坤真寓舍，世事直秋毫。\n我与巢由辈，真为莫逆交。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆舍弟","author":"庄昶","text":"天边闻一雁，杳杳向南徂。\n今夜西风冷，他乡小弟孤。\n五人千里去，九月一书无。\n欲作千行泪，凭谁寄客途。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汎江和寿卿","author":"庄昶","text":"放艇夫何意，天机忽远林。\n川云元浩荡，鱼鸟自高深。\n万里平生眼，三人此日心。\n因思邵康节，终日打乖吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次孤鹤老人观物亭坐雨 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"江山通一雨，深似老夫清。\n稍稍花全落，沉沉鼓未晴。\n坐当新竹拜，睡起早霞明。\n知我出门懒，连阴故有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次孤鹤老人观物亭坐雨 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"小阁题诗坐，高怀散远秋。\n风花聊沈谢，行止自轲丘。\n野暝微孤树，江清著数鸥。\n与君真自厚，不是雨相留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李德孚林缉熙还南海 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"细雨桄榔树，清泉苦竹根。\n先生旧家业，风日短篱门。\n归计携诸友，迎舟立两孙。\n能寻白沙子，同醉浊醪尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李德孚林缉熙还南海 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"契合乾坤大，逢君胜白头。\n江山如会意，天道此停舟。\n久大贤人业，稀疏软布裘。\n千峰不可见，明月在高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和容彦昭","author":"庄昶","text":"世人无限事，南亩领农夫。\n佳气山长在，秋江鹤自孤。\n风流还我老，尘俗是君无。\n朗月孤舟夜，能来共五湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芝轩为江阴王景悦题","author":"庄昶","text":"万古祯祥意，如今付此吟。\n朝廷真极治，芝草又江阴。\n薄雾千茎紫，微风众叶深。\n商歌人共赏，谁复会予心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣像寺","author":"庄昶","text":"圣像移舟入，僧佳寺亦佳。\n白云何处所，秋径此袈裟。\n细雨怜棕叶，香风问橘花。\n野人幽僻甚，随意宿烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与孤鹤翁汎江","author":"庄昶","text":"江晚真堪画，烟中树树清。\n两人携小桨，万里荡秋溟。\n醉眼岐周凤，虚名楚国萍。\n西山知我意，个个矗银屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中招廷信","author":"庄昶","text":"往来频旧雨，今雨可相辞。\n留取一尊酒，赏公千古诗。\n风流真麈尾，跌荡更花枝。\n自扫门前立，能来莫遣迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答廷信","author":"庄昶","text":"花鸟三年句，江楼坐不辞。\n风骚真有此，老子是何诗。\n印月深江水，盘空老铁枝。\n君无怜俗眼，我已识君迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送任生之","author":"庄昶","text":"轩腾都治凤，淡寂祗冥鸿。\n尊酒堪谁别，人心自古同。\n行藏真此道，天地各深衷。\n相对秋江上，芙蓉正晚红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄奉吉水周先生 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"十载师生义，千年父子恩。\n投桃真可报，没齿岂须论。\n白首沧江远，青天泰岳尊。\n平生衣钵梦，长绕鉴湖村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄奉吉水周先生 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"几年仁水望，别恨不蹉跎。\n一老应谁似，诸郎过我多。\n春寻扶过子，酒醉舞东坡。\n不得亲藜杖，其如感愧何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄奉吉水周先生 其三","author":"庄昶","text":"稽颡西江使，今年又手书。\n先生真会面，弟子喜何如。\n坐问犹消息，缄开数起居。\n自怜鞭策远，痴钝老难除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄奉吉水周先生 其四","author":"庄昶","text":"一仕开曾许，当年本未能。\n回头非自爱，多病果相仍。\n把钓浑孤艇，摊书又几灯。\n冰兢他日地，切恐误师承。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重庆堂为何侍御作","author":"庄昶","text":"食报无涯地，谁言我易论。\n此心还日月，老眼自乾坤。\n白发垂诸老，青云荡一门。\n更知尧舜事，四海一君恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄掌教吴先生","author":"庄昶","text":"三年怀此老，何处是衢州。\n眼界真千里，空中正一楼。\n人心周凤鸟，天道鲁春秋。\n此意今谁领，空江自白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"藏书室","author":"庄昶","text":"太上初寥寂，人文只可悲。\n汗牛千卷是，注我六经谁。\n日月开尼父，乾坤自伏羲。\n病夫何所有，默坐定山痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洗砚池","author":"庄昶","text":"两在真难测，先生示此传。\n浮云虽白日，本色自青天。\n朱子方塘镜，濂溪太极圈。\n此池吾亦有，观物草亭前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍松轩","author":"庄昶","text":"古今如此老，盖世几英豪。\n草阁三千尺，苍龙五百条。\n乾坤中独立，冰雪气难骄。\n欲问平生业，撑天手正高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹圃","author":"庄昶","text":"玩物非吾事，聊观造化功。\n春深三月后，公醉万花中。\n蓓蕾先天妙，衣冠太古风。\n此园虽独乐，还与众人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"门外柳","author":"庄昶","text":"万物皆为我，开门柳忽深。\n江湖閒坐处，天地此时心。\n风月豪真在，箪瓢乐可寻。\n元来程主簿，今古一閒吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陇头云","author":"庄昶","text":"阴偶为阳得，颓然只太虚。\n偶观神妙处，一笑老横渠。\n默默从升䧏，无无自卷舒。\n青天横老眼，吾亦坐吾庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绣衣记","author":"庄昶","text":"六经元土苴，天地只微尘。\n蜗篆曾谁笔，醯天偶自春。\n我非文字眼，公殆屋乌人。\n回也箪瓢乐，无言万古贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11618,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太史铭","author":"庄昶","text":"造化俄千古，文章便六经。\n百年须我在，此石更谁凭。\n英爽轩河朔，鸢鱼荡草亭。\n乾坤留老手，著与太行青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得閒老人 其一","author":"庄昶","text":"总总红尘是，匆匆白发皆。\n不知何处里，乃有此翁来。\n僧与看山得，江从钓月该。\n莫言忙绝少，趁雨菊寻栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得閒老人 其二","author":"庄昶","text":"每将迂自哂，此老似还迂。\n世上千年调，山中一卷书。\n病长无扰扰，静只有如如。\n老我青天眼，浮云看卷舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":11621,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]